  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for OpenTelemetry distributed-tracing (System.Diagnostics.Activity) assertions in .NET test projects. Captures Activity spans from an ActivitySource through a raw ActivityListener into a disposable, per-test SpanCapture. Foundation release: the fuller span-query surface (find-by-operation-name and tag, parent/child navigation) and the broader fluent assertions land in 0.1.0. Test-framework assertion entry points live in adapter packages (TracingAssertions.TUnit). AOT-compatible, trimmable, no runtime reflection, and no NuGet runtime dependency (System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource is in the shared framework).",
